# Files in the repo that are not part of the website.
#
# The assets directory is the repository root, so without this list every one of
# these is uploaded and served publicly - CLAUDE.md and .gitignore were both
# returning 200 on the live site. Config and working notes have no
# business being fetchable from a marketing page.
#
# gitignore syntax. _headers is absent deliberately: Cloudflare consumes it as
# configuration and already declines to serve it.

CLAUDE.md
wrangler.jsonc
.assetsignore
.gitignore
